{"vid":"ZXV8KKTrO8Q","source":"ZXV8KKTrO8Q.en-en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"NARRATOR: Are your meetings like this, packed with jargon,"},{"t":3.3,"txt":"boring slides, and silence?"},{"t":6.4,"txt":"Or maybe your digital transformation is off track."},{"t":9.5,"txt":"Good ideas aren't landing, and everyone's stretched too thin."},{"t":14,"txt":"They're all Tin Man problems, symptoms of organizations built"},{"t":17.6,"txt":"for a 20th century manufacturing world, efficient,"},{"t":21.7,"txt":"process-oriented, and rigid."},{"t":24,"txt":"They run on hierarchy, gatekeeping, and risk aversion."},{"t":28,"txt":"They're overly engineered and incapable of dealing"},{"t":31.2,"txt":"with the unexpected."},{"t":33,"txt":"But today's world is more complex, more"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"like the open ocean."},{"t":37,"txt":"And if you dropped a Tin Man in the ocean,"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"enter the octopus, nature's master"},{"t":43.1,"txt":"of learning and adaptation."},{"t":45.2,"txt":"It doesn't just repeat patterns."},{"t":46.9,"txt":"It learns and changes."},{"t":48.6,"txt":"Color, texture, behavior, everything"},{"t":50.9,"txt":"adapts to thrive in a complex environment."},{"t":53.9,"txt":"Its intelligence is distributed."},{"t":56.1,"txt":"Each arm can sense and act independently."},{"t":59,"txt":"Yet, all eight arms can coordinate and work in harmony."},{"t":62.3,"txt":"Now imagine an organization like that, fluid, curious,"},{"t":65.9,"txt":"constantly learning everywhere."},{"t":67.8,"txt":"Priorities are clear, ideas shared freely."},{"t":71.6,"txt":"Meetings flow, and there's no room for jargon."},{"t":74.4,"txt":"The goal isn't to present, it's to discover."},{"t":77.4,"txt":"That's an octopus organization, smart, adaptive, self-aware,"},{"t":82,"txt":"nimble, and built to thrive in uncertainty."},{"t":85,"txt":"You can start to become one today."},{"t":86.7,"txt":"[MUSIC PLAYING]"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"NARRATOR:"},{"t":0,"w":"Are"},{"t":0,"w":"your"},{"t":